This is the rad_astro-write-a-block package meant as a guide to building
out-of-tree packages. To use the rad_astro blocks, the Python namespaces
is in 'rad_astro', which is imported as:

    import rad_astro

See the Doxygen documentation for details about the blocks available
in this package. A quick listing of the details can be found in Python
after importing by using:

    help(rad_astro)


gr_modtool bind avg


run ldconfig!!